          "body": "## Phase 7C — Edge Function Integration Tests\n\n### Context\nAfter migration we need a test suite that verifies all Edge Functions behave correctly as a system.\n\n### Scope\nWrite integration tests for each Edge Function covering both success and failure paths:\n\n- `search`: returns issues, handles empty results\n- `evaluate`: scores correctly, filters below threshold\n- `engage`: posts when safety checks pass, blocks when they fail\n- `sync`: updates sync_health, handles no tracked issues\n- Authentication: 401 returned on all functions when token missing\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Tests exist for all 6 Edge Functions\n- [ ] Success and failure paths both covered\n- [ ] Authentication failure returns 401\n- [ ] Safety gate failure returns `{ posted: false }` not an error\n- [ ] Tests runnable locally with `supabase functions serve`",
